config GMK70_RADIO
    bool "GMK70 stock vendor-radio Bluetooth and dongle endpoint"
    depends on BOARD_GMK70_WIRED && GMK70_ZMK_STUDIO_SETTINGS
    select GMK70_BATTERY
    help
      Reuse the sole UART3 battery owner for stock keyboard/consumer reports,
      channel selection and pairing without modifying radio firmware or bonds.
      Native USB remains available for Studio and the guarded updater.

config GMK70_RADIO_QUALIFICATION
    bool "Temporary radio qualification with a fixed F24 test marker"
    depends on GMK70_RADIO
    default n
    help
      Separate, explicitly named development image only. Adds one bounded
      F24 press/release test command; normal images do not contain this entry.
